er.com/feeds/32869165/3419787330313640516/comments/default/7728356298249093119'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3419787330313640516/comments/default/7728356298249093119'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/04/revenge-of-waco-gene.html?showComment=1240247700000#c7728356298249093119' title=''/><author><name>Sans Authoritas</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/04/revenge-of-waco-gene.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3419787330313640516' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3419787330313640516' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 20, 2009 at 11:15 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2431797986526791291</id><published>2009-04-20T03:45:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2009-04-20T03:45:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Anon 4:54: Are you sure the Homegrown Terrorism Pr...</title><content type='html'>Anon 4:54: Are you sure the Homegrown Terrorism Prevention Act died in the Senate? Everything I read about it says that it is still in committee, but in spite of that, some of the provisions have been implemented. A few articles stated that there&#39;s been a &quot;news blackout&quot; on it every since it passed the House.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3419787330313640516/comments/default/2431797986526791291'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3419787330313640516/comments/default/2431797986526791291'/><link rel='a